# Corresponding source — HighAsCG live image

Generated @GENERATED_AT@ by `tools/release/collect-third-party-licenses.sh` from `tools/release/licenses/SOURCES.md.in`.

Parts of this image are free software under the GNU GPL (v2 and v3), the LGPL and the MPL. Their licences entitle
