## Written offer

For at least three years after the date above, and for as long as this image is offered for download, anyone who
received the image can get the complete corresponding source of any GPL- or LGPL-licensed component on it, at no
charge. Ask through https://github.com/mko1989/highascg/issues and name the image file and the component. The
directions below are given first so that most sources need no request.

