### Ubuntu packages

Every package installed from the Ubuntu archive or from a PPA is listed with its exact source package and version in
`third-party/ubuntu-packages.tsv`. Get the source of one with `apt-get source <source>=<version>`, or download it from
https://launchpad.net/ubuntu/+source/<source>/<version> (older versions also via https://snapshot.ubuntu.com/).
Each package's licence is in `/usr/share/doc/<package>/copyright` on this image.
